⚡🇧🇷 Brazilian presidential candidate Flávio Bolsonaro's running mate, Congressman Alfredo Gaspar, is facing allegations of statutory rape after Brazil's Federal Police requested authorization from the Supreme Court to investigate the case.

According to the complaint, the alleged abuse involved a 13-year-old girl and resulted in a pregnancy. Gaspar denies the allegations and says he is the "greatest interested party" in having the investigation move forward. The case has been awaiting action at the Supreme Court since April.

@medmannews

⚡️🇨🇳 China announces that two coastguard personnel died in the vessel collision where a PLAN destroyer rammed into a Chinese coast guard ship in a friendly-fire incident last year.

Rest in peace to Yi Xinyu (21 years old) and Chen Long (25 years old). They were both from Shandong province. They were both pothumously awarded a first-class merit citation. 

